    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if there is a \"next way of being.\" i feel like the chapter is just... done. you know? like when an athlete retires, the career is over, and the person who was the athlete isn't really there anymore. i feel like i'm just waiting for the credits to roll on a movie that already finished playing an hour ago.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
